stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> REQUESTED: Customer initiates booking via Pincode/Service
    REQUESTED --> MATCHING: AI Match Engine analyzes candidate pool
    MATCHING --> ASSIGNED: Best qualified local cooperative worker allocated
    ASSIGNED --> ACCEPTED: Worker accepts dispatched shift
    ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED: Customer or Worker cancels before dispatch
    ACCEPTED --> ON_THE_WAY: Worker initiates travel (live ETA broadcast)
    ON_THE_WAY --> ARRIVED: Worker arrives at customer doorstep
    ARRIVED --> IN_PROGRESS: Doorstep 4-digit safety OTP validated
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: Service completed, payment verified & wallet credited
    COMPLETED --> REVIEWED: Customer submits rating & media proof (photos/video)
    IN_PROGRESS --> DISPUTED: Customer files complaint regarding work quality
    DISPUTED --> RESOLVED: Society Admin / Registrar arbitrates resolution
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REVIEWED --> [*]
    RESOLVED --> [*]
